The Kombat [[FFA]] event is a standalone event with a €510 (EUR) prize pool. The idea of the event was to get some [[FFA]] going on several new maps and make a showcase of it on a good stream. Some classic maps are added as well. To make it interesting we made a little prize pool; it is not much but registration/playing is free so it is indeed free money for playing some Quakeworld for a couple of hours. The top 8 players get paid: minimum €30 (EUR) for top 8.

The event will be streamed on [https://www.twitch.tv/suddendeathtv suddendeathTV] / [https://www.twitch.tv/qw_link/ qw_Link]
<br>
<br>
All VODs are linked at each table. Enjoy!

